; ======== DTC_Update_Immediate  (@0xd9436) ========
        ; DTC_Update_Immediate(recordPtr, cfgPtr): immediate (non-debounced) fault set/heal. Same record/cfg
        ; layout as DTC_Update_Debounced. Caller presets dtc_test_result (0=pass/heal, else fault-type bits
        ; 1/2/4/8) then calls this to set or clear the DTC in one pass. This is the entry the SMARTRA
        ; immobilizer uses, e.g. dtc_test_result=8; DTC_Update_Immediate(0xd522,0x58f8). Returns updated
        ; status/occurrence.
